---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

<Section id="dispatch" number="02" label="Dispatch" title="Pick a task, pick an agent, go.">
  <p class="sub">
    Dispatch from the board. Claude Code today, more harnesses coming.
  </p>
  <figure>
    <img
      class="shot"
      src="/shots/runs.jpg"
      alt="A run in Dispatch: the session turn by turn, with what the agent read, edited and ran"
      width="1680"
      height="960"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <figcaption class="caption">
      A run. What the agent said, read, edited and ran, and what it cost.
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
  <dl class="notes">
    <div>
      <dt>Warden</dt>
      <dd>One chat to steer every session. It asks first.</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>Blocked means blocked</dt>
      <dd>Blocked tasks don't dispatch.</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
</Section>

<style>
  figure {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .notes {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .notes div {
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    background: var(--surface-card);
  }
  dt {
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  dd {
    margin: var(--space-1) 0 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .notes {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
